      "body": "解决画画的时候不知道画什么的问题\r\n1、无聊的时候可以画点什么，可以从最简单的画圆开始，看看你画的圆能得多少分吧\r\n![whattodraw](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba74561f-eb8d-4274-b399-8e8b9aa8b23a)\r\n\r\nMy circle is 90.89% perfect, can you beat that? https://whattodraw.art\r\n![whattodraw-score4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e67e3fd-e977-428a-a828-73b884a03e0f)\r\n\r\n2、生成器：按照简单、中等、难随机生成画画的主意\r\n![whattodraw2](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b42fa687-5cad-4782-a8b6-cedf55c8b2c3)\r\n\r\n3、旋转转盘，自定义画什么的想法，随机旋转选择1个\r\n![whattodraw3](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fac09297-5c33-425a-ae02-edf390ede0a1)\r\n\r\n4、网站地址：https://whattodraw.art",
